21,328 bytes; SHA-256 bdd7e29edb509a08eb0c125a7b9e8d07ab10f23985234119a38c952b49ed54bc. Exact-path no-index diff check emitted no whitespace errors; the seven linked repository documents still exist; the unchanged 12-bead reference set resolved on the preceding exact draft check.

Priced review patches applied:
- segmentation is now exact contiguous cells/boundaries with eligible mask and competing plans;
- overlapping/discontinuous semantic supports are a separate artifact layer;
- explicit many-to-many cell/artifact incidence plus compatibility receipts is bound into family/fixed-view/result/report identity and rendered separately;
- baseline construction and fixed-view qualification are source-blind, exclude nominations/P/F/Viterbi/signature/endpoints, and bind a recall-feature lineage ledger; any later source-informed child is labelled and cannot masquerade as primary;
- the first screen publishes this conditioning beside diagnostic/not-calibrated;
- the governing construction-integrity artifact is adopted by bead rather than hard-coded as revision 3;
- construction route, conformance, authenticity, use admission, calibration, and optional provider identity are separate;
- the shareable static report displays verified PTS and a path-free copyable command; exact playback is a separate local CLI/runtime action whose caller-supplied media is re-verified and never written into the bundle. The crosswalk proves time mapping, not path reachability.

Focused re-review requested only on the science blockers above and on the product playback conflict. Please reply APPROVE or BLOCK with an exact remaining falsifier.
